      <div>
        <p source="#source-11025-11203"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11025-11040"><rb>燦</rb><rt>きら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11040-11058">らかにごむの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11058-11082"><rb>大樹</rb><rt>たいじゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11082-11085">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11085-11097"><rb>射</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11097-11103">す光</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11103-11121"><rb>燦</rb><rt>きら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11121-11130">らかに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11130-11145"><rb>円</rb><rt>まろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11145-11148">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11148-11160"><rb>眠</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11160-11163">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11163-11199"><rb>正覚坊</rb><rt>しやうがくぼう</rt></ruby></p>
