        <p source="#source-11479-11600"><seg source="#source-11479-11494">こはをかし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11494-11512"><rb>柔</rb><rt>やはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11512-11524">かなこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11524-11539"><rb>腋</rb><rt>わき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11539-11545">の下</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11545-11563"><rb>擽</rb><rt>くす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11563-11600">ぐればふふと笑ふ正覚坊</seg></p>
